OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgency' needed to make schools
OL,4,Asafer after paedophile head jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSafeguarding recommendations made after
OL,7,Fa "depraved" paedophile head teacher
OL,8,Fwas jailed for sexually abusing girls
OL,9,Fhave not been implemented quickly
OL,10,Fenough, the children's commissioner for
OL,11,FWales has said.
OL,13,FNeil Foden was jailed for 17 years in
OL,14,F2024 after being found guilty of sexual
OL,15,Fabuse involving four girls over a
OL,16,Ffour-year period.
OL,18,FA year after the review - Our bravery
OL,19,Fbrought Justice - it has been
OL,20,Fdiscovered that just three of the 13
OL,21,Frecommendations had been completed.
